+    planes (``planes``), ``NT`` the selection's bucket (``FullRows.bucket``; 0: no sparse row), ``sel`` its scratch.
+    Writes every row's latent, rotary and (full indexer layer) index keys into its stream's extent, rotates the
+    queries at their own positions, selects on a full indexer layer, absorbs, attends: b.lat_s.ol[:R].
