+                 RS: tl.constexpr, FP8: tl.constexpr, QP=None, KR=None, ROPE: tl.constexpr = 0,
+                 FP4: tl.constexpr = 0, R8: tl.constexpr = 0, RSW: tl.constexpr = 0):
+    """Program (row, head block, chunk): HBT heads of row r over keys [c CH, (c + 1) CH) of its stream: a dense row
+    (SPR 0) over keys 0 .. POS[r] (_dense_chunks), a sparse one over its selected tokens in list order
+    (_sparse_chunks; CNT[r] of them); cache rows BASE[r] + key (latents, scales and rotary keys alike). R8
+    (TF_GLM_KV=fp4x): the rotary rows through ``_rope_tile`` (e4m3 codes, scales in the FP4 latent rows' pad)."""
